  "description": "IsItValid is a powerful and flexible validation library designed to simplify data validation in .NET applications. It provides a fluent API for defining and enforcing validation rules on various data types, including primitives, strings, collections, dates, and custom objects. With built-in support for common validation scenarios and extensibility for custom rules, IsItValid ensures data integrity and consistency in your applications.",
